  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 702.04 \"Septic pumping\" means the removal of sludge and scum from a septic or holding tank system for transport to appropriate disposal facilities.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 700) #13889, eff 4-22-24",
